    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d93-a1">

                <pb facs="0194" n="132" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg132"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No 311.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stahel to Mr. Seward.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 25,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to inclose herewith copy of a letter from the Shanghai Chamber
                    of Commerce in reply to my dispatch No. 11,402, concerning copies of your
                    excellency’s memorandum on the currency of China.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. STAHEL,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Vice-Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
